g/8eRvtTrp25lO3CH9kAq2QJdct_GxkQDz322VgN9tlYA\"/><figcaption>樂天女孩林岱縈（岱縈）（Facebook@林岱縈 Lin Daiying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂天女孩林岱縈（岱縈）（Facebook@林岱縈 Lin Daiying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251210/1075382373903765504630857.jpeg/fDBLfYIzBvwk5SWCt3oT7bJ2ue3sMDfZlEQ9gpREPYI\"/><figcaption>樂天女孩林岱縈（岱縈）（Facebook@林岱縈 Lin Daiying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914833688645079040081365.jpeg/ThBB1Ksy0a3IuAmGB9EFQZ-G5kAdJIOcJd5WuiXeVro\"/><figcaption>林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914833674309210112172943.jpeg/N6mncPQsFFwwd4dfkc3Fhy_4gjHaPlMP99lC_vfZQv4\"/><figcaption>林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240927/916404545427345408347028.jpeg/6u62dNur1F2dMYJRvRkdXbVaay_oiMVaB-e48QfnuPE\"/><figcaption>啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231231/818199996099989504214859.jpeg/qVfuVcahpSf8rOKpT2TQw7u6EhvzHEcjzoSS8s6EkvI\"/><figcaption>啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231231/818199999740907520394670.jpeg/nXiG6iNb2JMIRn5R9n3PHc1vh5Tg2yQ5q8caTqvHGk4\"/><figcaption>啦啦隊女神「小鹿」林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林岱縈（IG@daiying0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914833665681395712384520.jpeg/BP0k22AJT9-msrvtWgdbgrStL-Y5qVGKwILlg8CC5YM\"/><figcaption>林岱縈（IG@daiying0）</figcaption></figure><p>汶汶遭砍兇嫌被起底！夏語心證實曾被尾隨回家：天天在電視台等我</p><p>謝翔雅認出砍汶汶兇嫌！揭「每場活動都會來」　昔日狂粉身分曝光：真的有夠可怕</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T09:58:55.807515+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1869,"images":37,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}